    {
      "id": "odin-fenrir",
      "fondo": "batalla",
      "camara": {
        "de": 0,
        "a": 500,
        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.08
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En el campo, Odín avanza contra Fenrir, el lobo, y los dos se encuentran de frente.",
          "en": "On the field, Odin advances against Fenrir the wolf, and the two meet head-on."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero el lobo abre sus fauces enormes y se traga a Odín entero, el padre de todos los dioses.",
          "en": "But the wolf opens his enormous jaws and swallows Odin whole, the father of all the gods."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces avanza Víðarr, el hijo silencioso de Odín, que esperaba este momento.",
          "en": "Then Vidar steps forward, Odin's silent son, who had been waiting for this moment."
        },
        {
          "es": "Con un pie en la mandíbula inferior del lobo, agarra la superior con la mano y le desgarra la boca. Así venga a su padre.",
          "en": "With one foot on the wolf's lower jaw, he grips the upper with his hand and tears his mouth apart. So he avenges his father."
        },
        {
